  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-469-490">ひとあし踏みて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-490-505"><rb>夫</rb><rt>つま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-505-516">思ひ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-516-551">ふたあし國を思へども、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-551-554">三</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-554-572"><rb>足</rb><rt>あし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-572-601">ふたゝび夫おもふ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-601-629">女心に咎ありや。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-629-661">朝日に匂ふ日の本の、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-661-690">國は世界に唯一つ。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-690-725">妻と呼ばれて契りてし、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-725-759">人も此世に唯ひとり。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-759-768">かくて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-768-789"><rb>御國</rb><rt>みくに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-789-792">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-792-816"><rb>我夫</rb><rt>わがつま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-816-821">と</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-821-856">いづれ重しととはれなば</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-856-891">たゞ答へずに泣かんのみ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-891-929">お百度まうであゝ咎ありや</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-929-1001" style="padding-inline-end: 2em; text-align: right">
        <p>（明治三十八年一月「太陽」）</p>
      </div>
    </body>
